# The repository stores every text file with LF, and checks it out with LF on every
# platform, so `.editorconfig`'s `end_of_line = lf` describes what a working tree
# actually holds. Without this, `core.autocrlf` decided per developer: blobs landed
# LF, Windows trees were CRLF, and `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` passed locally
# while rewriting all 82 .cs files on the Linux CI runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.db binary
*.ico binary
